  "scope": "Selected published reports and native responses only; no encrypted proof, repository envelope, native database or full archive is committed.",
  "hash_contract": "Hosted-report hashes bind downloaded artifact members. Published hashes bind committed projections. Embedded raw_sha256 fields refer to original native streams privately retained in encrypted proof; public_sha256/public_path in captured command records refer to the hosted report namespace, including omitted members, not necessarily a committed file.",
