    "The execution recorder replaced the owned root, checkout, runner home/hostname/username and known synthetic secrets before uploading reports.",
    "This publication replaces symbolic password-file locations in selected report argv with role placeholders and opaque synthetic result identifiers with stable aliases. Original report hashes remain alongside publication hashes; original native argv/streams remain identified by proof hashes.",
    "Empty/incidental install/build/service streams are not copied; their identities remain in command records and the hosted artifacts. No secret values or concrete private key locations are copied."
  ],
